{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0576E0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Huey应该也跟你说过，在Mother Base能生产的零件是有限的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"所以<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>的AI决定沿用你从那些AI兵器上拔下来的记忆板。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那样能行吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"人类的大脑并不是一个部件只负责一种功能。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"我们的AI也是一样。多个承担某种功能的部件彼此协作，从而强化那项功能。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"比如，控制传感器的记忆板越多，索敌能力就越强；搭载更多负责机动的记忆板，机动力就会提高。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"也就是说，AI的能力会根据搭载的记忆板而改变？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"没错。想强化AI的功能，就需要收集更多记忆板。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""}]}